{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03R1", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nCentral simple algebras are classified by Galois cohomology of PGL.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$K$", "MATH_0002": "$K^{sep}$", "MATH_0003": "$d$", "MATH_0004": "$K$", "MATH_0005": "$H^1(\\text{Gal}(K^{sep}/K), \\text{PGL}_d(K^{sep}))$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-central-simple-algebra-pgln}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4fa699f1029b8456ea09e974c718a23bc8946e70cb08e2a6ff24587d86b9b507", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:26d96347c1bb8521a5ae7d0fa4cc71f165b688ee77fa864e1799efa0600aaa56", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a field and let <MATH_0002> be a separable algebraic closure.\nThen the set of isomorphism classes of central simple algebras of degree\n<MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004> is in bijection with the non-abelian cohomology\n<MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3190d34935cf09968fb4754e6b3f3ff4a2e2f505cf969b8e9028d39442eea593", "unit_id": "tag:03R6:statement"}
